# A mixed line in the default mode, implicit and left to right, read back
# through the display view (ADR-1004 D14): the Hebrew word reversed in
# place, the bracketed digit beside it and its brackets mirrored
# spec: ADR-1000 text.bidi
# capability: bidi
size 20 1
view display
send "abc \u{5E9}\u{5DC}\u{5D5}\u{5DD} (1) def"
check
want row 0 |abc (1) םולש def|
want display-cursor 16,0 left
